Not sure if this is intended, but I'm facing this issue right now.

Say if you have a mixin file called `mixins.less`:

```
.a-mixin {
  background: red;
}
```

And you import it as a reference inside a selector:

```
.a-selector {
  @import (reference) "a-mixin.less";
}
```

You'd expect nothing gets outputted, but there is an output:

```
.a-selector {
  .a-mixin {
    background: red;
  }
}
```
